{
  "notes": "candidate-60 at tp4-switched with the DSpark turn learner in observe mode mounted from overlay/: each request's draft rows kept in a 256-step ring inside the draft graph, the turn replayed when it finishes (drafts reproduced, teacher-forced acceptance counted), rank 0 writing each turn to /cache/turn-learning; no draft or weight changes",
